long-term trend, but El Niño has a strong, well-established effect toward a more humid Mar–May, and this year's shift is larger than a normal year-to-year swing. For Mar–May 2027, a cooler-than-normal season is slightly favored (about 45%), about 0.3 °C below the 1991–2020 average; a wetter-than-normal season is likely (about 70% chance), and a more humid season than normal is likely (about 80% chance). The El Niño expected for Sep–Nov 2026 is stronger than any in the record used here, so the outlook extends the historical relationship beyond what has been observed. This outlook is based on the El Niño strength expected for Sep–Nov 2026 and will be updated when it is observed in early December.","variables":{"temperature":{"normal_1991_2020":22.551,"trend_per_decade":0.3778,"trend_p":0.0,"trend_total_since_1951":2.8334,"enso_effect_per_degC":-0.4059,"enso_p":0.0025,"confidence":"Strong","survives_fdr":true,"fraction_explained":0.1197,"intrinsic_sd":1.0316,"effect_this_season":-1.0269,"effect_ratio":0.9955,"size":"Substantial","size_typical_el_nino":"Substantial","once_every_n_years_without_el_nino":6,"expected_anomaly_2027":-0.2969,"forecast_mean":22.254,"forecast_sd":1.1219,"p_below":0.429,"p_near":0.3853,"p_above":0.1857,"forecast_words":"Slightly favored (43%): a cooler-than-normal season","within_record":false,"trend_part_2027":0.73,"roni_upper_within_record":false,"years_of_warming_equivalent":-27.1826,"percentiles":{"p05":{"trend_per_decade":0.4451,"trend_p":0.0,"enso_effect_per_degC":-0.1804,"enso_p":0.2923,"confidence":"No identifiable effect","shift_this_season":-0.4565,"lines_cross":false},"p50":{"trend_per_decade":0.407,"trend_p":0.0,"enso_effect_per_degC":-0.4396,"enso_p":0.0111,"confidence":"Clear","shift_this_season":-1.1122,"lines_cross":false},"p95":{"trend_per_decade":0.3362,"trend_p":0.0,"enso_effect_per_degC":-0.177,"enso_p":0.3852,"confidence":"No identifiable effect","shift_this_season":-0.4479,"lines_cross":false},"tails":{"enso_difference":0.0